        "<strong>自回归 SMILES agent</strong>：无条件模型学习 <span class=\"kb-math kb-math-inline\">P(T)</span>，条件模型学习 <span class=\"kb-math kb-math-inline\">P(T\\mid S)</span>，用 teacher forcing 最小化 token 级 NLL",
